              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"tap-breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <span>›</span> <a href=\"/masters\">Masters</a> <span>›</span> <span>Feramis Aktas</span></div><span class=\"tap-eyebrow\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px\">— Master luthier · Istanbul, Turkey</span><h1 class=\"tap-h1\" style=\"font-size:72px\">Feramis Aktas</h1><p class=\"tap-lead\" style=\"max-width:680px\">"Each oud takes 14 days. The wood decides when it's ready, not me." — Feramis has been building ouds in his Üsküdar workshop since 1996. Tapadum has worked with him since 2018.</p><div class=\"tap-ml-stats\"><div><span class=\"n\">28</span><span class=\"l\">Years building</span></div><div><span class=\"n\">42</span><span class=\"l\">Instruments at Tapadum</span></div><div><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"l\">Apprentices</span></div></div><div class=\"tap-hero-cta\"><a href=\"/shop?master=feramis\" class=\"tap-btn-primary\">Browse 42 instruments →</a><a href=\"/blog/14-days-with-feramis\" class=\"tap-btn-link\">Read the workshop visit ↗</a></div><style>.tap-ml-stats{display:flex;gap:48px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E8DFC8;border-bottom:1px solid #E8DFC8;margin:24px 0}.tap-ml-stats > div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.tap-ml-stats .n{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:42px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1612;line-height:1}.tap-ml-stats .l{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8b7f6a}</style>"
